   "html": "<p>Between the years of 2012 and 2020, IHC produced mini campaigns for Adult Swim including tours for the KRFT PUNK’S Political Party Premiere, Desert Gold Coachella Party, Decker Meet &amp; Greet, Adult Swim at San Diego Comicon, Eric Andre Show Live! Tour, and the Adult Swim Pitchfork Festival.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "KRFT PUNK’S Political Party Premiere 2019",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We hosted an exclusive early screening of the Eric Andre Show spin-off, paired with the first and only performance from KRFT PUNK himself Dan Curry, a Q&amp;A with Eric, and cheesy Kraft Singles parting gift for all.</p>"
    },
