  {
   "title": "Desert Gold Coachella Party 2018",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We partnered with BMW to produce two days of music, sound baths, Aqua Teen Hunger Force’s Meatwad narrated yoga, giveaways, and more at the Palm Springs Ace Hotel.</p>"
