  {
   "title": "Decker Meet & Greet 2017",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>To celebrate the new season of the #1 American TV show: Decker, we hosted and produced a fan meet and greet at Baller Hardware in Los Angeles, complete with an exclusive music listening experience and special prizes.</p>"
