  {
   "title": "Adult Swim at SDCC 2013",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Multiple years IHC supported Adult Swim’s presence at SDCC through targeted and stunty marketing campaigns. When they needed additional event production, IHC also oversaw any off-site events, including live performances of The Eric Andre Show and Hot Package.</p>"
