  {
   "title": "Eric Andre Show Live! Tour 2013",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Following the success of Pitchfork Festival, we continued to produce shows in Los Angeles and at Comic-Con, also featuring Yacht, for the series. We also tour managed and oversaw marketing for both national tours.</p>"
